ど。","nextNodeIds":[726830129]},{"nodeId":726830129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":513852506,"text":"結果…はは…見ての通り。出発からまだそう経ってないのに、私にはきついみたい…","nextNodeIds":[726830130]},{"nodeId":726830130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":787866658,"text":"はぁ、やっぱり冒険者協会に依頼して、「写真機」を持っている冒険者に手伝ってもらうしかないかな。","nextNodeIds":[726830131]},{"nodeId":726830131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3418727530,"text":"ん？「写真機」なら…","nextNodeIds":[726830132,726830134]},{"nodeId":726830132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3417736594,"text":"持ってるけど…","nextNodeIds":[726830133]},{"nodeId":726830133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":57782106,"text":"え！？君、写真機を持ってるの？","nextNodeIds":[726830135]},{"nodeId":726830135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2244114002,"text":"冒険者に「写真機」で写真を撮ってもらいたいの！","nextNodeIds":[726830136]},{"nodeId":726830136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":309696626,"text":"外には面白い場所がたくさんあるって聞いたんだ！例えば、モンドの近くにある高い雪山とか、璃月にある柱がたくさん立っているところとか…","nextNodeIds":[726830137]},{"nodeId":726830137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":1719574738,"text":"それに！璃月には「絶雲の間」っていう場所があってね、そこには仙人が住んでいるらしいの！","nextNodeIds":[726830138]},{"nodeId":726830138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":3706640154,"text":"仙人が住む場所…想像するだけでわくわくするよね…","nextNodeIds":[726830139]},{"nodeId":726830139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":340312986,"text":"私は体調のせいで、そこへは行けないけど…","nextNodeIds":[726830140]},{"nodeId":726830140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":4276121346,"text":"でも、もし君が代わりに「写真機」で景色を撮ってくれたら…私も必ず…コホッコホッ！","nextNodeIds":[726830141]},{"nodeId":726830141,"rol